---

<section id="home" class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content reveal">
        <p class="tagline">INDEPENDENT CREATIVE PARTNERSHIP</p>
        <h1>DREAM BIGGER.<br /><span>CREATE BEYOND.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">
            NOVA brings bold ideas to life through thoughtful design and purposeful technology.
            A creative collaboration by yabut_ and Senayo.
        </p>
        <a href="#about" class="button-primary">Discover NOVA <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-image reveal" aria-label="NOVA abstract visual">
        <span class="hero-orb" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">N<span>.</span></span>
        <span class="hero-index" aria-hidden="true">Nº 01 — IDEAS IN MOTION</span>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .hero {
        min-height: min(780px, calc(100svh - 70px));
        padding: 90px max(6%, calc((100vw - 1200px) / 2));
        background: #0b0b0b;
        color: white;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: clamp(35px, 7vw, 100px);
        overflow: hidden;
        background:
            radial-gradient(ellipse at 77% 49%, rgb(255 59 48 / 12%), transparent 34%),
            #0b0b0b;
    }

    .tagline {
        color: #ff3b30;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
    }

    h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(46px, 7.3vw, 92px);
        line-height: .98;
        font-weight: 850;
        letter-spacing: -.075em;
    }

    h1 span {
        color: #ff3b30;
    }

    .hero-description {
        color: #aaa;
        line-height: 1.8;
        max-width: 450px;
        margin: 26px 0 30px;
    }

    .button-primary {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 15px 22px;
        background: #ff3b30;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 4px;
        transition: transform .2s, background .2s;
    }

    .hero-image {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        height: 400px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 15px;
        border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 12%);
        background:
            linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 49.7%, rgb(255 255 255 / 8%) 50%, transparent 50.3%),
            radial-gradient(circle at 70% 30%, rgb(255 59 48 / 18%), transparent 34%),
            #171719;
    }

    .hero-mark {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #f5f5f6;
        font-size: clamp(130px, 16vw, 210px);
        font-weight: 850;
        letter-spacing: -.12em;
        text-shadow: 14px 12px 0 rgb(255 59 48 / 10%);
    }

    .hero-mark span { color: #ff3b30; }

    .hero-orb {
        position: absolute;
        right: -55px;
        bottom: -85px;
        width: 220px;
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 12%);
        border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .hero-index {
        position: absolute;
        right: 16px;
        bottom: 14px;
        color: #aaaab2;
        font-size: 9px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: .16em;
    }

    @media(max-width: 750px) {
        .hero {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
